{"sha": "428e6a8e536e4ff2aeaa58766971b5ef32939bc87df97d5138164f73d35046c6", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "求导，得 $\\frac{dx}{dt} = -\\frac{2\\pi}{T_0}A \\sin(\\frac{2\\pi", "t}{T_0} + \\varphi)$；再求一次导，$\\frac{d^2x}{dt^2} = -(\\frac{2\\pi}{T_0})^2", "A\\cos(\\frac{2\\pi t}{T_0} + \\varphi) = -(\\frac{2\\pi}{T_0})^2\\,x(t)$,", "即 $-(k/m)\\,x$，当且仅当 $(2\\pi/T_0)^2 = k/m$ 时成立。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[所有可能的运动]\\label{rem:g12:oscillators-and-time:uniqueness}", "滑块的\\emph{每一种}运动都是这些函数之一，这一点", "在本阶段不加证明地承认，其证明见本科一年级分册。另外，$g$ 不出现在 $2\\pi\\sqrt{m/k}$ 中：", "劲度系数越大，振动越快；质量越大，振动越慢；在月球上也是如此。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{definition}[振幅与相位]\\label{def:g12:oscillators-and-time:phase}", "在 $x(t) = A\\cos(2\\pi t/T_0 + \\varphi)$ 中，正常数 $A$ 称为", "振幅 --- 最大位移处为 $x = \\pm A$ --- 而 $2\\pi t/T_0 +", "\\varphi$ 称为\\emph{相位}\\index{相位}，每过一个周期", "增加 $2\\pi$；\\emph{初相位}\\index{初相位} $\\varphi$", "记录起始状态：自 $x = A$ 处静止释放时，$\\varphi = 0$。例如，", "当 $m = \\qty{0.20}{kg}$、$k = \\qty{20}{N/m}$ 时，得 $T_0 =", "2\\pi\\sqrt{0.20/20} = \\qty{0.63}{s}$；将其拉至 \\qty{5.0}{cm} 处，", "释放后 $x(t) = 5.0\\cos(2\\pi t/0.63)$，单位为厘米。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\section{能量、阻尼与共振}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[振子的能量]\\label{prop:g12:oscillators-and-time:energy}", "伸长量为 $x$ 的弹簧储存的弹性势能为 $E_p =", "\\tfrac12 kx^2$（依据见\\cref{ch:g12:work-and-energy}）。无摩擦", "的振动中，机械能", "\\[", "E_m = E_k + E_p = \\tfrac12 m v^2 + \\tfrac12 k x^2 = \\tfrac12 k A^2", "\\]", "保持不变：最大位移处全部为弹性势能，平衡位置处全部为动能。", "单摆在 $E_k$ 与重力势能", "$E_p$ 之间进行同样的能量转换（见\\cref{ch:g11:mechanical-energy}）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "记 $v = \\frac{dx}{dt}$，则 $E_m$ 的导数为 $mv\\frac{dv}{dt}", "+ kx\\frac{dx}{dt} = v\\,(m\\frac{d^2x}{dt^2} + kx) = 0$，由运动", "方程；数值 $\\tfrac12 kA^2$ 在最大位移处读出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=4.6cm, xlabel={$t/T_0$},", "    ylabel={能量 $/\\,E_m$}, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=0, ymax=1.3,", "    legend pos=south east]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1, samples=120] {cos(360*x)^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:1, samples=120] {sin(360*x)^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, thick, domain=0:1, samples=2] {1};", "  \\legend{$E_p$, $E_k$, $E_m$}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一个周期内，从 $x = A$ 处释放：能量在弹性势能与动能间往返两次，", "总量恒为 $\\tfrac12 kA^2$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[阻尼振动]\\label{def:g12:oscillators-and-time:damping}", "摩擦力会从每个实际振子中耗散机械能：其", "自由振动为\\emph{阻尼}\\index{阻尼}振动。在轻阻尼", "情形下，系统仍做振动，振幅逐渐衰减，但", "周期几乎不变，此即\\emph{准周期}%", "\\index{准周期}，接近 $T_0$；在重阻尼（如蜂蜜中）", "系统缓慢回到平衡位置，而不再越过它；能量", "与振幅的平方成正比，最终耗散为热量。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=4.6cm, xlabel={$t$ (\\unit{s})},", "    ylabel={$x$ (\\unit{cm})}, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=-2.6, ymax=2.6,", "    legend pos=south east]", "  \\addplot[omExo, thin, domain=0:10, samples=240] {2*cos(deg(pi*x))};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:10, samples=240] {2*exp(-x/4)*cos(deg(pi*x))};", "  \\legend{无阻尼, 有阻尼}", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=0:10, samples=60, forget plot] {2*exp(-x/4)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=0:10, samples=60, forget plot] {-2*exp(-x/4)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 无阻尼与轻阻尼振动：周期几乎相同，", "（此处为 \\qty{2.0}{s}），阻尼振动的振幅", "在逐渐收缩的指数包络线（虚线）内衰减。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[受迫振动与共振]\\label{def:g12:oscillators-and-time:resonance}", "对振子施加周期性推动 --- 即\\emph{受迫振动}%", "\\index{受迫振动} --- 经过短暂过渡后，它", "以\\emph{驱动}频率 $f$ 振动，而非其自身的频率。", "其振幅在 $f$ 接近自由振子的\\emph{固有频率}%", "\\index{固有频率} $f_0$ 时达到峰值：此即", "\\emph{共振}\\index{共振}：每次推动都与", "运动同步，每个周期都输入能量；阻尼越轻，", "峰值越高、越尖锐。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=4.6cm, xlabel={$f/f_0$},", "    ylabel={振幅（任意单位）}, xmin=0, xmax=2.2, ymin=0, ymax=5.6,", "    legend pos=north east]", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:2.2, samples=200] {1/sqrt((1-x^2)^2 + (x/5)^2)};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:2.2, samples=120] {1/sqrt((1-x^2)^2 + (x/1.2)^2)};", "  \\legend{轻阻尼, 重阻尼}", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, forget plot] coordinates {(1,0) (1,5.4)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}